# DianaSh golden corpus. Recorded from the C# shell, byte for byte; EMUSEN_DIANASH_GOLDEN=record rewrites it - see EmuSen_DianaSh.md §13.4.
# Patterns: <ROOT> is the sandbox's real root, <TEMP> the corpus's real temporary folder, <INSTALL> the install's real directory;
# a 'match' block is a regular expression the whole output must match, written where a line prints a time or a measured number.
command log
usage 1   log off                       silence every logging flag at once, without changing them
usage 2   log on                        restore whatever each logging flag was individually set to
usage 3   log status                    show whether the master switch is currently on or off

case the master switch
target none
covers 1-3
$ log
out 266
  log off                       silence every logging flag at once, without changing them
  log on                        restore whatever each logging flag was individually set to
  log status                    show whether the master switch is currently on or off
status 0
action none
$ log status
out 15
Logging is off.
status 0
action none
$ log off
out 46
Logging disabled (individual flags unchanged).
status 0
action none
$ log status
out 15
Logging is off.
status 0
action none
$ log on
out 16
Logging enabled.
status 0
action none
$ log status
out 14
Logging is on.
status 0
action none
$ log frob
out 266
  log off                       silence every logging flag at once, without changing them
  log on                        restore whatever each logging flag was individually set to
  log status                    show whether the master switch is currently on or off
status 0
action none
end
